msgstr "View and edit bot settings at runtime."

# | msgid "cmd.profile.help"
#: modmail/cogs/utility/commands/config.py:576
msgid "cmd.config.help"
msgstr ""
"View and edit bot settings at runtime without editing the file by hand. "
"Changes are written to `config.toml` and take effect after a restart.\n"
"\n"
"**Subcommands**\n"
"- **/config show** — Browse all keys and their current values.\n"
"- **/config set** — Change a value with smart parsing for booleans, "
"numbers, strings, arrays, tables, and batch operations.\n"
"- **/config unset** — Reset a key to its built-in default.\n"
"- **/config reload** — Re-read `config.toml` from disk.\n"
"\n"
"Start with `/config show` to browse, or use `/config set <key> <value>` "
"to change a setting directly."

# | msgid "cmd.profile.name"
#: modmail/cogs/utility/commands/config.py:574
msgid "cmd.config.name"
msgstr "config"

